    Take icli 0.7.6 so IPAs zipped on a Mac install
    
    IcliKit 0.7.5 counted AppleDouble sidecars as bundles: an IPA made with
    Finder's Compress or ditto without --norsrc carries Payload/._Name.app,
    and apps.install refused it with "IPA must contain exactly one
    Payload/*.app". 0.7.6 skips __MACOSX and ._* files during extraction
    and in the container bundle lookup.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

